    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/ac0fdeef808f0438b27494b51293e8c8.poster.avif?t=1754294606\" width=615 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/ac0fdeef808f0438b27494b51293e8c8.webm?t=1754294606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>The Banker Tycoon</strong> is an engaging simulation game where you <strong>build and manage the bank</strong> of your dreams. Start by <strong>setting strategic prices</strong> for your services, then<strong> recruit the best employees</strong> to ensure top-notch operations. <strong>Customize and expand your bank</strong> to fit your vision, enhancing its features and capabilities. As your bank grows, your prestige will increase, drawing in wealthier clients and establishing your institution as a leader in the financial world. Navigate challenges, innovate, and climb to the top of the banking industry to become the ultimate banking tycoon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/8fd4a54ffc30f1bafdbab330e19a24fd.webp?t=1754294606\" width=256 height=56 /></span><strong>Create and customize detail of your bank, expand your services and decorate it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add more Counters/desks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand the seating areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance the decor and ambiance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Address employee needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade facilities for better customer service</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/98092530123a7f0a1c9c2b3ba88f95f6.poster.avif?t=1754294606\" width=615 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/98092530123a7f0a1c9c2b3ba88f95f6.webm?t=1754294606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/a4d5cf29ab93be555d87a2a00e32a94e.webp?t=1754294606\" width=262 height=56 /></span><strong>Determine which services each employee should provide based on their skills.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire different types of employees based on your bank\u2019s needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit specialists for specific roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train employees to enhance their skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your workforce for maximum efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ researchers to develop and introduce new services that attract more clients</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/e08e58628a2b44147ce2ec1ca94b15fb.poster.avif?t=1754294606\" width=615 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/e08e58628a2b44147ce2ec1ca94b15fb.webm?t=1754294606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/7ae0077178dc632ee266a7892b89db08.avif?t=1754294606\" width=272 height=69 /></span><strong>Unlock new services through the research tree to attract different types of customers, expanding your bank\u2019s offerings and reaching a broader client base.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/4f9b5f813db5428efcf99acd13c2dbb9.poster.avif?t=1754294606\" width=615 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/4f9b5f813db5428efcf99acd13c2dbb9.webm?t=1754294606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
