ps/3022560/extras/7ae0077178dc632ee266a7892b89db08.avif?t=1754294606\" width=272 height=69 /></span><strong>Unlock new services through the research tree to attract different types of customers, expanding your bank\u2019s offerings and reaching a broader client base.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/4f9b5f813db5428efcf99acd13c2dbb9.poster.avif?t=1754294606\" width=615 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022560/extras/4f9b5f813db5428efcf99acd13c2dbb9.webm?t=1754294606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
